State IDLE as "準備待ち" color "#4F46E5":
    開始を待つ
State RUNNING as "実行中" color "#22C55E":
    要求を処理する
State RECOVERING as "復旧中" color "#F97316":
    実行を復旧する
State DONE as "完了" color "#0284C7":
    正常に終了した
State FAILED as "失敗" color "#FF0000":
    異常を記録した

StateGroup WORK as "稼働系":
    IDLE
    RUNNING
    RECOVERING

EventCategoryHeaders "系統" > "区分" > "種別"
Event START as "開始" in "操作" > "運転"
Event RETRY as "再試行"

Transition IDLE on START -> DONE:
    要求を記録する
Transition RUNNING on START:
    Common:
        検査を記録する
    Branch "許可" -> DONE:
        -
    Branch "異常" -> FAILED:
        通知する
Transition RECOVERING on RETRY -> IDLE:
    復旧を記録する
Transition IDLE on RETRY -> IDLE:
    再確認する
Transition DONE on RETRY -> -:
    -
